.TH RADIUM 1 radium\-VERSION
.SH NAME
Radium Window Manager
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B radium
.RB [ \-v ]
.RB [ \-c
.IR config ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Radium is a dynamic window manager for X.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-v
prints version information to stderr, then exits.
.TP
.BI \-c " config"
runs
.I config
instead of ~/.config/radium/init.lua.